> Everything else on this page is **optional** — the library assumes
> industry-standard defaults when fields are left blank.
>
> **You do not need to read the rest of this file** if you are using the
> Quick Start prompt (`.ai-prompts/QUICK_START.md`) — the agent will
> gather everything it needs from you in plain language.

